post.summary:
Publish new resource to product server. The "parentFolder" in "sourceNodes" is the target Server path which will publish to, and "sourcePath" is the Server path which will publish from. So in the sample,  {
  "parentFolder": "/Test",
  "sourcePath": "/SampleReports/Employee Information List.cls"
} We will publish the page report from "/SampleReports/Employee Information List.cls" to "/Test/Employee Information List.cls".
